
<p>Greg Joswiak on X:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Over 200,000 apps are now optimized for iPhone Duo! That number
DOUBLED in just over a week.</p>
</blockquote>

<p>I’m back on my Duo review unit to test the new face unlock feature, and I’ve already noticed more apps are Duo optimized. Oddly enough, the first one I checked that still isn’t Duo-optimized is Apple’s own <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/apple-store/id375380948">Apple Store app</a>, which was last updated 3 months ago. Weird.</p>

<p><strong>Update:</strong> The very next day, the Apple Store app was updated with full optimization for the Duo. But then the store’s <a href="https://daringfireball.net/linked/2026/11/17/apples-cloud-services-are-having-a-bad-day">back end went down for several hours</a>.</p>

